# Maintainers

zever is maintained by the `@zenta-dev` org team. There is no separate
maintainer roster: anyone in the org with merge rights is a maintainer.

- Day-to-day review happens on PRs; public API changes need an explicit
  maintainer review (see [GOVERNANCE.md](GOVERNANCE.md#decisions)).
- Security reports go through GitHub Security Advisories, not personal
  inboxes (see [.github/SECURITY.md](.github/SECURITY.md)).
- To become a maintainer: sustained, reviewed contributions over several
  releases, nominated by an existing maintainer.
